{"title":"Talon Torso","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 41)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 41 <span class=\"muted\">(3488 XP)</span> from 8× <a href=\"#/item/gold-bar\">Gold Bar</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/harpy-talon\">Harpy Talon</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/264420239c726a73de34.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/harpy-talon\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/cf4d2e12bc404da2b413.svg\" alt=\"\">Harpy Talon</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/67356212b97c6762c60b.svg\" alt=\"Talon Torso\"></div><h3>Talon Torso</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Armor Smithing 41</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}